        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: The host of Carousel (comics)\n- Works: Carousel (comics), Waiting for Godot, Beavis and Butt-Head, \"Waiting for Go\"\n- Series: \"The Vault of Horror\"\n\nFacts:\n- The host of Carousel (comics) creates comic adaptations of literature classics.\n- The host of Carousel (comics) mixes classics such as Waiting for Godot with Beavis and Butt-Head.\n- The host of Carousel (comics) creates an adaptation titled \"Waiting for Go\" from Waiting for Godot and Beavis and Butt-Head.\n- These comic adaptations are presented under the series title \"The Vault of Horror\".",
